rable' must be interpreted as non-negative. Thus, favorable outcomes are only 0 in B (50%) and none in A. So B has 50% on favorable (0), A has 0% on favorable. Therefore, A has a higher proportion of probability on unfavorable outcomes (100% vs 50%), so A is more right-skewed. The reason would prefer A.",
